    "Q5_dependencies": "Acceptance of the five theorems as valid; principle of sufficient reason; logical coherence as a criterion",
    "Q6_consequences": "Forces a choice between infinite regress, brute fact, or self-grounding terminus; undermines naturalism and closed-system materialism",
    "Q7_kill": "If any of the five theorems were disproven; if a closed system could be shown to self-ground; if the principle of sufficient reason is rejected"
  },
